            <div xml:id="d830-a3">

                <pb facs="0810" n="712" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg712"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr. Michahellis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince Haiti</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-04-19"><hi rendition="#italic">April 19,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Colleague</hi>: I have your kind favor with
                    the accompanying documents. Accept my thanks for same. I shall take a copy and
                    will endeavor to return them to you to-morrow.</p>
                <p>The prevailing influenza has affected about one-half of my clerical force.</p>
                <p>Again thanking you for this act of kindness, I remain, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. F. Powell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
